raw:
1. [LOCAL] Define the list of tech companies to track. | out companies
2. [READ] Search for recent news articles for each company. | out news_articles | api A | args {"q": "$step1.companies"}
3. [READ] Extract the text content from the retrieved news articles. | out article_content | api A | args {"url": "$step2.news_articles.url"}
4. [PROCESS] Analyze the sentiment of the extracted article text. | out sentiment_scores | api E | args {"text": "$step3.article_content.text"}
5. [READ] Fetch the current stock price for each company. | out stock_prices | api A | args {"ticker": "$step1.companies.ticker"}
6. [LOCAL] Calculate the daily percentage change in stock price. | out price_changes
7. [LOCAL] Filter companies showing significant price movement. | out movers
8. [PROCESS] Summarize the news sentiment for the filtered companies. | out summary_text | api C | args {"text": "$step7.movers.sentiment"}
9. [LOCAL] Compile the daily market research report content. | out report_content
10. [LOCAL] Format the report data for spreadsheet rows. | out formatted_rows
11. [WRITE] Append the report rows to the online spreadsheet. | out spreadsheet_status | api A | args {"spreadsheet": "$user.spreadsheet_id", "sheet": "$user.sheet_number", "rows": "$step10.formatted_rows"}

1. [READ] Read upcoming trip details from calendar. | out trips | api A | args {"calendarId": "$user.calendar_id", "eventId": "$user.trip_event_id"}
2. [LOCAL] Extract flight numbers and destination cities. | out flights
3. [READ] Search status of airline flights. | out flight_status | api D | args {"FlightNumber": "$step2.flights.flight_number", "AirlineCode": "$step2.flights.airline_code", "DepartureDate": "$step2.flights.departure_date"}
4. [READ] Get current weather at location. | out weather | api D | args {"city": "$step2.flights.destination_city"}
5. [LOCAL] Filter active and delayed flight segments. | out active_flights
6. [PROCESS] Convert currency amounts to base currency. | out converted_prices | api B | args {"amount": "$step3.flight_status.price", "from": "$step3.flight_status.currency", "to": "$user.home_currency"}
7. [LOCAL] Determine weather impact on travel plans. | out weather_impact
8. [PROCESS] Summarize status weather and cost data. | out summary | api C | args {"text": "$step5.active_flights|$step6.converted_prices|$step7.weather_impact"}
9. [LOCAL] Format alert message for mobile device. | out alert_msg
10. [WRITE] Send push notification to mobile phone. | out push_status | api B | args {"t": "Trip update", "m": "$step9.alert_msg", "d": "$user.device_id", "k": "$user.pushsafer_key"}

1. [LOCAL] Define the target city and the category of events to monitor. | out search_criteria
2. [READ] Search for upcoming public events in the target city. | out events | api C | args {"name": "$step1.search_criteria.city", "minDate": "$step1.search_criteria.start", "maxDate": "$step1.search_criteria.end"}
3. [LOCAL] Extract the venue address from the event details. | out venue_address
4. [PROCESS] Convert the venue address into geographic coordinates. | out coords | api C | args {"text": "$step3.venue_address"}
5. [READ] Fetch the current weather forecast for the extracted coordinates. | out forecast | api A | args {"lat": "$step4.coords.lat", "lon": "$step4.coords.lon"}
6. [LOCAL] Filter the events based on the weather forecast. | out filtered_events
7. [LOCAL] Format the event data and weather report into a single string. | out task_description
8. [LOCAL] Construct the task description with organized fields. | out task_fields
9. [LOCAL] Select the appropriate project board and list for the task. | out task_board
10. [WRITE] Create a new task in the project management tool. | out task_result | api B | args {"title": "Public events in $step9.task_board", "description": "$step8.task_fields"}

1. [LOCAL] Define the list of monitored asset symbols. | out assets
2. [READ] Fetch the current market price for each asset. | out prices | api B | args {"ticker": "$step1.assets"}
3. [LOCAL] Calculate the price change percentage from the baseline. | out changes
4. [LOCAL] Identify assets whose price has exceeded a volatility threshold. | out volatile_assets
5. [READ] Search for recent financial news articles related to the identified volatile assets. | out news_articles | api C | args {"symbol": "$step4.volatile_assets"}
6. [READ] Extract the text content from the retrieved financial news articles. | out article_text | api A | args {"url": "$step5.news_articles.url"}
7. [PROCESS] Summarize the extracted financial news text. | out summary | api E | args {"text": "$step6.article_text.text"}
8. [PROCESS] Analyze the sentiment of the summarized news text. | out sentiment | api E | args {"text": "$step7.summary"}
9. [LOCAL] Format the combined market and sentiment report. | out report
10. [WRITE] Send the formatted report as an email. | out email_status | api B | args {"to": "$user.email", "subject": "Market sentiment summary", "body": "$step9.report"}

1. [LOCAL] Define search keywords for company mentions. | out search_terms
2. [READ] Search news articles for specified keywords. | out news_articles | api B | args {"q": "$step1.search_terms"}
3. [LOCAL] Filter search results by publication date. | out filtered_articles
4. [READ] Extract text content from news article URL. | out article_content | api D | args {"url": "$step3.filtered_articles.url"}
5. [LOCAL] Clean and normalize raw article text. | out cleaned_text
6. [PROCESS] Summarize text content into brief report. | out summary_report | api D | args {"text": "$step5.cleaned_text"}
7. [PROCESS] Analyze sentiment of the news article. | out sentiment_score | api B | args {"text": "$step5.cleaned_text"}
8. [LOCAL] Format summary and sentiment as lead note. | out lead_note
9. [LOCAL] Validate CRM lead record fields. | out validated_lead
10. [WRITE] Create contact record in CRM system. | out created_contact | api A | args {"Content-Type": "application/json", "name": "$step9.validated_lead.name", "email": "$step9.validated_lead.email"}

1. [READ] Fetch the top trending music tracks from YouTube. | out trending_tracks | api E | args {"country": "$user.country"}
2. [LOCAL] Select the top three trending track titles from the fetched list. | out selected_titles
3. [READ] Search for the lyrics of the selected track titles. | out lyrics_data | api D | args {"name": "$step2.selected_titles"}
4. [LOCAL] Clean the retrieved lyrics text for further processing. | out cleaned_lyrics
5. [PROCESS] Analyze the lyrical themes from the cleaned lyrics text. | out lyrical_analysis | api A | args {"text": "$step4.cleaned_lyrics"}
6. [LOCAL] Aggregate the lyrical insights into a single summary for all tracks. | out aggregated_summary
7. [LOCAL] Draft the social media post based on the aggregated summary. | out draft_post
8. [LOCAL] Format the draft post content to fit within character limits. | out formatted_post
9. [LOCAL] Validate the formatted post content against social media platform rules. | out validated_post
10. [WRITE] Publish the validated post content to the social media account. | out post_status | api A | args {"title": "Weekly music update", "body": "$step9.validated_post", "url": "$user.blog_url"}

1. [LOCAL] Read candidate movie titles. | out movies
2. [READ] Retrieve movie details for each title. | out movie_data | api C | args {"q": "$step1.movies.title"}
3. [LOCAL] Extract rating runtime and trailer link. | out movie_info
4. [LOCAL] Select highest rated movie. | out pick
5. [WRITE] Create calendar event for screening. | out screening_event | api A | args {"calendarId": "$user.calendar_id", "summary": "$step4.pick.title", "start": "2026-05-15T19:00:00", "end": "2026-05-15T21:00:00", "location": "$user.home"}
6. [PROCESS] Generate short link for trailer. | out trailer_link | api C | args {"destination": "$step4.pick.trailer_url"}
7. [LOCAL] Compose movie night text with link. | out night_text
8. [WRITE] Send movie night text to team. | out sms_status | api C | args {"to": "$user.team_list", "message": "$step7.night_text"}
9. [LOCAL] Rank remaining titles for next time. | out rank
10. [LOCAL] Format movie night summary for organizer. | out summary

1. [LOCAL] Load this month's donation records. | out donations
2. [PROCESS] Validate each donor email address. | out valid | api C | args {"email": "$step1.donations.email"}
3. [PROCESS] Convert foreign donations into dollars. | out usd_donations | api B | args {"amount": "$step1.donations.amount", "from": "$step1.donations.currency", "to": "USD"}
4. [LOCAL] Fill receipt template for each donor. | out receipts_html
5. [PROCESS] Convert receipts into PDF files. | out receipts_pdf | api C | args {"html": "$step4.receipts_html"}
6. [WRITE] Upload receipt files to cloud drive. | out receipt_links | api E | args {"file": "$step5.receipts_pdf"}
7. [WRITE] Send receipt email to each donor. | out email_status | api B | args {"email": "$step2.valid.email", "subject": "Your donation receipt", "text": "$step6.receipt_links", "from": "$user.sender_email", "login": "$user.smtp_login", "password": "$user.smtp_password"}
8. [LOCAL] Find donors not on newsletter list. | out new_list
9. [WRITE] Add new donors to newsletter list. | out list_status | api A | args {"address": "$step8.new_list.email", "name": "$step8.new_list.name", "subscribed": "yes", "upsert": "yes", "apiKey": "$user.api_key"}
10. [LOCAL] Total monthly donations in dollars. | out total_usd

1. [LOCAL] Read campaign message and donation page. | out campaign
2. [LOCAL] Write image prompt from campaign message. | out image_prompt
3. [PROCESS] Generate campaign image from prompt. | out campaign_image | api E | args {"prompt": "$step2.image_prompt"}
4. [PROCESS] Generate short link for donation page. | out short_url | api B | args {"destination": "$step1.campaign.donation_url"}
5. [PROCESS] Generate QR code for donation link. | out qr_code | api B | args {"url": "$step4.short_url"}
6. [LOCAL] Assemble campaign post with image and link. | out post_body
7. [WRITE] Publish campaign post on social media. | out post_status | api A | args {"title": "Give today", "body": "$step6.post_body", "url": "$step1.campaign.donation_url"}
8. [LOCAL] Compose supporter email with QR code. | out supporter_email
9. [WRITE] Send campaign email to supporter list. | out email_status | api A | args {"email": "$user.supporter_list", "subject": "Giving day", "text": "$step8.supporter_email", "from": "$user.sender_email", "login": "$user.smtp_login", "password": "$user.smtp_password"}
10. [WRITE] Send share request text to volunteers. | out sms_status | api C | args {"phone": "$user.volunteer_phones", "message": "$step4.short_url", "key": "$user.sms_api_key"}

1. [LOCAL] Read cafe name and search terms. | out cafe
2. [READ] Search news mentions of cafe name. | out mentions | api A | args {"keyword": "$step1.cafe.name", "language": "en"}
3. [LOCAL] Remove mentions already seen. | out fresh_mentions
4. [PROCESS] Analyze sentiment of each mention. | out sentiment | api C | args {"text": "$step3.fresh_mentions.text"}
5. [LOCAL] Select negative mentions for follow up. | out negative
6. [WRITE] Create follow-up task for negative mention. | out tasks | api B | args {"title": "Negative mention follow up", "description": "$step5.negative.text"}
7. [LOCAL] Compose staff chat message per mention. | out chat_msg
8. [WRITE] Send mention message to staff chat. | out chat_status | api E | args {"m": "$step7.chat_msg", "bot_token": "$user.bot_token", "chat_id": "$user.chat_id"}
9. [LOCAL] Pick most positive mention of week. | out top
10. [WRITE] Publish weekly thank-you post on social media. | out post_status | api C | args {"title": "Thank you", "body": "$step9.top.text", "url": "$user.cafe_url"}

1. [LOCAL] Load performer list with song titles. | out performers
2. [READ] Retrieve lyrics for each song. | out lyrics | api B | args {"name": "$step1.performers.songs"}
3. [PROCESS] Analyze emotional tone of lyrics. | out tone | api A | args {"text": "$step2.lyrics"}
4. [LOCAL] Flag songs with negative or explicit tone. | out flagged
5. [LOCAL] Order performers into time slots. | out schedule
6. [WRITE] Create calendar event for open mic. | out mic_event | api A | args {"calendarId": "$user.calendar_id", "summary": "Open mic night", "start": "$user.mic_start", "end": "$user.mic_end", "location": "$user.venue"}
7. [LOCAL] Compose slot text for each performer. | out slot_texts
8. [WRITE] Send slot time text to performers. | out sms_status | api A | args {"phone": "$step7.slot_texts.phone", "message": "$step7.slot_texts.text", "key": "$user.sms_api_key"}
9. [LOCAL] Compose running order message. | out running_order
10. [WRITE] Send running order to volunteers chat. | out chat_status | api D | args {"chat_id": "$user.chat_id", "text": "$step9.running_order"}

1. [LOCAL] Load auction item descriptions. | out items
2. [LOCAL] Write illustration prompt per item. | out prompts
3. [PROCESS] Generate illustration for each item. | out illustrations | api C | args {"prompt": "$step2.prompts", "style": "illustration", "ratio": "1:1", "steps": "25", "cfg": "7", "sampler": "euler", "controlNet": "none"}
4. [LOCAL] Lay out catalog html with items. | out catalog_html
5. [PROCESS] Convert catalog html into PDF. | out catalog_pdf | api B | args {"html": "$step4.catalog_html", "orientation": "portrait", "paper_size": "A4"}
6. [WRITE] Upload catalog file to cloud drive. | out catalog_link | api E | args {"file": "$step5.catalog_pdf"}
7. [PROCESS] Generate short link for catalog. | out short_url | api C | args {"destination": "$step6.catalog_link"}
8. [LOCAL] Compose auction announcement post. | out post
9. [WRITE] Publish auction announcement on social media. | out post_status | api E | args {"title": "Charity auction", "body": "$step8.post", "url": "$step7.short_url"}
10. [WRITE] Send catalog link email to bidders. | out email_status | api A | args {"email": "$user.bidders", "subject": "Charity auction catalog", "text": "$step7.short_url", "from": "$user.sender_email", "login": "$user.smtp_login", "password": "$user.smtp_password"}

1. [LOCAL] Load pet vaccination records. | out pets
2. [LOCAL] Find pets due booster soon. | out due
3. [LOCAL] Compose booster reminder per owner. | out reminders
4. [PROCESS] Translate reminders for owners preferring other language. | out translated | api B | args {"text": "$step3.reminders", "from_language": "en", "to_language": "es"}
5. [WRITE] Send booster reminder text to owners. | out sms_status | api B | args {"to": "$step2.due.owner_phone", "text": "$step4.translated"}
6. [LOCAL] Collect owners who replied yes. | out confirmed
7. [WRITE] Book booster appointment for confirmed pets. | out appointments | api E | args {"clinicName": "$user.clinic_name", "date": "$user.appointment_date", "patient": "$step6.confirmed.name"}
8. [LOCAL] Build weekly booster list per vet. | out list_text
9. [WRITE] Send booster list email to vets. | out email_status | api D | args {"email": "$user.vet_emails", "subject": "This week's booster list", "text": "$step8.list_text", "from": "$user.sender_email", "login": "$user.smtp_login", "password": "$user.smtp_password"}
10. [LOCAL] Flag pets overdue without reply. | out overdue

1. [LOCAL] Load followed club identifiers. | out clubs
2. [READ] Retrieve upcoming fixtures for each club. | out fixtures | api A | args {"id": "$step1.clubs"}
3. [LOCAL] Keep fixtures in coming matchweek. | out matchweek
4. [LOCAL] Extract match city and kickoff time. | out match_info
5. [READ] Retrieve weather forecast for each match city. | out forecast | api C | args {"locationName": "$step4.match_info.city"}
6. [LOCAL] Flag matches with heavy rain forecast. | out wet_matches
7. [LOCAL] Lay out matchweek preview html. | out preview_html
8. [PROCESS] Convert matchweek preview into PDF. | out preview_pdf | api D | args {"html": "$step7.preview_html", "orientation": "portrait", "paper_size": "A4"}
9. [WRITE] Upload preview file to cloud storage. | out preview_link | api E | args {"file": "$step8.preview_pdf"}
10. [LOCAL] Compose league chat message with link. | out chat_msg
11. [WRITE] Send preview message to league chat. | out chat_status | api A | args {"m": "$step10.chat_msg", "bot_token": "$user.bot_token", "chat_id": "$user.chat_id"}

1. [READ] Retrieve tomorrow's forecast for garden city. | out forecast | api E | args {"locationName": "$user.garden_city"}
2. [READ] Retrieve sunrise time for garden city. | out sun_times | api A | args {"city": "$user.garden_city", "date": "$user.tomorrow"}
3. [LOCAL] Decide whether tomorrow is hot and dry. | out is_hot_and_dry
4. [LOCAL] Compute watering slot after sunrise. | out slot
5. [WRITE] Create calendar event for watering slot. | out slot_event | api A | args {"calendarId": "$user.calendar_id", "summary": "Garden watering", "start": "$step4.slot.start", "end": "$step4.slot.end", "location": "$user.garden"}
6. [LOCAL] Find volunteer on duty tomorrow. | out volunteer
7. [LOCAL] Compose watering reminder text. | out reminder
8. [WRITE] Send watering reminder text to volunteer. | out sms_status | api C | args {"phone": "$step6.volunteer.phone", "message": "$step7.reminder", "key": "$user.sms_api_key"}
9. [LOCAL] Compose garden chat note. | out chat_note
10. [WRITE] Send watering note to garden chat. | out chat_status | api C | args {"chat_id": "$user.chat_id", "text": "$step9.chat_note"}

1. [LOCAL] Define the list of tracked food ingredients. | out ingredients
2. [READ] Search for news articles containing the tracked ingredients. | out news_articles | api D | args {"q": "$step1.ingredients", "pageSize": "10", "autoCorrect": "true", "pageNumber": "1"}
3. [PROCESS] Extract the most relevant text from the retrieved news articles. | out news_text | api A | args {"url": "$step2.news_articles.url"}
4. [READ] Retrieve the current market price for the tracked ingredients. | out prices | api C | args {"q": "$step1.ingredients"}
5. [LOCAL] Compare the current prices to historical benchmarks. | out price_trend
6. [PROCESS] Analyze the sentiment of the extracted news text. | out sentiment | api E | args {"text": "$step3.news_text.text"}
7. [LOCAL] Synthesize the news trends and price data into a cohesive report. | out synthesis
8. [PROCESS] Summarize the synthesized findings into a weekly report. | out weekly_report | api E | args {"text": "$step7.synthesis"}
9. [LOCAL] Format the weekly report as an email body. | out formatted_body
10. [LOCAL] Schedule the email delivery to be sent weekly. | out schedule
11. [WRITE] Send the formatted weekly report via email. | out email_status | api C | args {"to": "$user.email_address", "subject": "Weekly food trends", "body": "$step9.formatted_body"}

1. [LOCAL] Define the target research field as "genetic engineering" and set the search scope to the last year. | out search_criteria
2. [READ] Search for recent news articles related to genetic engineering. | out news_articles | api A | args {"q": "$step1.search_criteria", "pageSize": "10", "autoCorrect": "true", "pageNumber": "1"}
3. [LOCAL] Select the most relevant research announcement from the retrieved news articles. | out selected_article
4. [READ] Extract the text content from the URL of the selected research article. | out article_content | api B | args {"url": "$step3.selected_article.url"}
5. [LOCAL] Clean and filter the extracted text to focus on the core findings. | out cleaned_text
6. [PROCESS] Generate a concise summary of the core findings from the cleaned text. | out summary | api C | args {"text": "$step5.cleaned_text"}
7. [LOCAL] Format the generated summary into a series of social media posts. | out post_series
8. [LOCAL] Check if the generated post series exceeds the character limit for social media platforms. | out adjusted_posts
9. [PROCESS] Analyze the sentiment and tone of the adjusted social media posts. | out tone_analysis | api B | args {"text": "$step8.adjusted_posts"}
10. [WRITE] Publish the adjusted social media posts to the user's feed. | out post_status | api C | args {"title": "Breakthrough in genetic engineering", "body": "$step8.adjusted_posts", "url": "$user.research_url"}

1. [LOCAL] Load open shipment tracking numbers. | out shipments
2. [READ] Retrieve tracking status for each shipment. | out tracking | api B | args {"trackingNumber": "$step1.shipments.tracking", "slug": "$user.carrier_slug", "apiKey": "$user.api_key"}
3. [LOCAL] Compare expected and current delivery dates. | out delays
4. [LOCAL] Select shipments past promised date. | out late_shipments
5. [READ] Look up local time in customer city. | out local_times | api E | args {"city": "$step4.late_shipments.city"}
6. [LOCAL] Hold messages outside customer business hours. | out hold_window
7. [LOCAL] Compose delay update for each customer. | out update_texts
8. [WRITE] Send delay update by SMS text message. | out sms_status | api C | args {"phone": "$step6.hold_window.phone", "message": "$step7.update_texts", "key": "$user.sms_api_key"}
9. [WRITE] Create support ticket for each delayed shipment. | out tickets | api A | args {"subject": "Delayed shipment", "comment": "$step4.late_shipments", "email": "$user.email", "domain": "$user.helpdesk_domain", "apiToken": "$user.api_token"}
10. [LOCAL] Tally delays by carrier and region. | out tally
11. [LOCAL] Compose morning delay summary. | out summary
12. [WRITE] Send delay summary email to manager. | out email_status | api D | args {"email": "$user.manager_email", "subject": "Delayed shipments today", "text": "$step11.summary", "from": "$user.sender_email", "login": "$user.smtp_login", "password": "$user.smtp_password"}

1. [LOCAL] Load weekly specials text. | out specials
2. [LOCAL] Split specials into individual dishes. | out dishes
3. [PROCESS] Analyze nutrition facts of each dish. | out nutrition | api A | args {"nutrientQuery": "$step2.dishes.description"}
4. [LOCAL] Write calorie line for each dish. | out calories
5. [PROCESS] Generate dish image from description. | out images | api B | args {"description": "$step2.dishes.description"}
6. [LOCAL] Build specials menu page. | out menu_html
7. [WRITE] Upload specials menu page to cloud storage. | out menu_url | api C | args {"file": "$step6.menu_html"}
8. [LOCAL] Write social caption for specials. | out caption
9. [WRITE] Post specials with menu link on social media. | out post_status | api E | args {"title": "This week's specials", "body": "$step8.caption", "url": "$step7.menu_url"}
10. [LOCAL] Compose short VIP text with menu link. | out vip_text
11. [WRITE] Send specials text to VIP list. | out sms_status | api D | args {"phone": "$user.vip_phones", "message": "$step10.vip_text", "key": "$user.sms_api_key"}

1. [LOCAL] Load photographed lab report and patient. | out report
2. [PROCESS] Extract text from lab report using OCR. | out report_text | api E | args {"url": "$step1.report.photo"}
3. [LOCAL] Parse test names values and ranges. | out parsed
4. [LOCAL] Flag values outside reference range. | out flagged
5. [PROCESS] Summarize lab report for doctor. | out summary | api D | args {"text": "$step2.report_text"}
6. [LOCAL] Decide whether follow-up visit needed. | out follow_up
7. [WRITE] Book follow-up appointment for flagged patient. | out appointment | api B | args {"clinicName": "$step1.report.clinic", "date": "$step6.follow_up.date"}
8. [LOCAL] Write patient note with next steps. | out patient_note
9. [PROCESS] Translate patient note into patient language. | out note_tr | api A | args {"text": "$step8.patient_note", "from_language": "en", "to_language": "$step1.report.language"}
10. [WRITE] Send translated note email to patient. | out email_status | api C | args {"email": "$step1.report.patient.email", "subject": "Your lab results", "text": "$step9.note_tr", "from": "$user.sender_email", "login": "$user.smtp_login", "password": "$user.smtp_password"}
11. [LOCAL] Attach summary and flags to patient file. | out file_flags

1. [LOCAL] Load newly added interface strings. | out strings
2. [PROCESS] Correct grammar of source interface strings. | out source_clean | api C | args {"text": "$step1.strings.source"}
3. [LOCAL] Apply accepted grammar fixes. | out strings_clean
4. [LOCAL] Protect placeholders before translation. | out placeholders
5. [PROCESS] Translate strings into target languages. | out translations | api D | args {"text": "$step4.placeholders", "from": "en", "to": "$user.languages"}
6. [LOCAL] Restore placeholders in translations. | out restored
7. [LOCAL] Flag translations exceeding length limit. | out too_long
8. [LOCAL] Write locale resource files. | out locale_files
9. [WRITE] Upload locale files to cloud storage. | out files_url | api C | args {"file": "$step8.locale_files"}
10. [WRITE] Create review task for translators. | out task | api C | args {"title": "Review translations", "description": "$step9.files_url"}
11. [LOCAL] Compose localization note for developers. | out note
12. [WRITE] Send localization note to team chat group. | out chat_status | api B | args {"m": "$step11.note", "bot_token": "$user.bot_token", "chat_id": "$user.chat_id"}

1. [LOCAL] Load team standup updates. | out standups
2. [LOCAL] Split updates into done doing blocked. | out triage
3. [PROCESS] Analyze sentiment of each update. | out tone | api E | args {"text": "$step1.standups.text"}
4. [LOCAL] Flag frustrated or blocked teammates. | out flags
5. [PROCESS] Summarize standup updates for team. | out summary | api B | args {"text": "$step2.triage.summary"}
6. [WRITE] Send standup summary to team chat group. | out chat_status | api E | args {"m": "$step5.summary", "bot_token": "$user.bot_token", "chat_id": "$user.chat_id"}
7. [WRITE] Create task for each blocker. | out tasks | api A | args {"name": "Standup blocker - $step4.flags", "accessToken": "$user.access_token", "eventType": "TASK"}
8. [LOCAL] Add day to weekly standup digest. | out digest
9. [LOCAL] Compose weekly digest for manager. | out digest_text
10. [WRITE] Send weekly digest email to manager. | out email_status | api D | args {"to": "$user.manager_email", "subject": "Weekly standup digest", "body": "$step9.digest_text"}

1. [LOCAL] Load early-bird buyers and session dates. | out course
2. [WRITE] Create user account for each buyer. | out accounts | api A | args {"name": "$step1.course.buyers.name", "idExternal": "$step1.course.buyers.id", "apiKey": "$user.api_key"}
3. [WRITE] Add buyers to course mailing list. | out members | api A | args {"address": "$step1.course.buyers.email", "name": "$step1.course.buyers.name", "subscribed": "yes", "upsert": "yes", "apiKey": "$user.api_key"}
4. [LOCAL] Compose login details email. | out login_email
